Step 1 — Install JWT package

cd IamEngine.Api
dotnet add package Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer

Step 2 — JWT settings

// appsettings.json — add this section
{
  "Jwt": {
    "Issuer": "IamEngine",
    "Audience": "IamEngine.Clients",
    "ExpiryMinutes": 60
  }
}

 * Note: Store the signing key as a secret, not in appsettings, the below command generates a random 256-bit key:

 dotnet user-secrets set "Jwt:Key" "$(openssl rand -base64 32)"

